@prefix backlog: <http://example.org/backlog#> .
@prefix ex:      <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1011simp-lineage#> .
@prefix owl:     <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs:    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .

<http://example.org/sen0414-ch1011simp-lineage> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "Urgent narrow lineage: SEN0414 chapters 10 and 11, one code, one environment"@en ;
    owl:versionInfo "1.42.0" ; owl:versionIRI <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1011simp-lineage/1.42.0> ; dcterms:identifier "sen0414_ch1011simp_lineage" ;
    rdfs:comment """1.42.0 (2026-11-25): The deliverable of scope change SC11_ExamResultsAll is groomed into one story with an acceptance criterion and three tasks. Grooming comes before any build file."""@en .

ex:AC11_ExamResultsAll a backlog:AcceptanceCriterion ; rdfs:label "Each of the 18 pages (chapters 1 to 9 and 12 to 20) has a new version with the Exam results tab and no release lock, differs from its previous version only in the exam parts and the version marks, and has a logged test run with no failure."@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage11 .
ex:ST11_ExamResultsAll a backlog:Story ; rdfs:label "Every presented chapter page: mock exam and exam results as two functions"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage11 ; backlog:hasState backlog:Ready ;
    backlog:appliesDefinitionOfDone ex:DoD11 ; backlog:hasAcceptanceCriterion ex:AC11_ExamResultsAll ;
    backlog:decomposesInto ex:TK11_ExamResultsAll_Tool, ex:TK11_ExamResultsAll_Pages, ex:TK11_ExamResultsAll_Verify .
ex:TK11_ExamResultsAll_Tool a backlog:ExecutionTask ; rdfs:label "Write the retrofit step: patch a built page, set its new version marks, copy its page data and manifest to the new version"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage11 ; backlog:hasTaskType backlog:TaskType_Build ; backlog:hasState backlog:Ready .
ex:TK11_ExamResultsAll_Pages a backlog:ExecutionTask ; rdfs:label "Retrofit the 18 pages and compare each with its previous version outside the exam parts"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage11 ; backlog:hasTaskType backlog:TaskType_Build ; backlog:hasState backlog:Blocked ;
    backlog:dependsOn ex:TK11_ExamResultsAll_Tool .
ex:TK11_ExamResultsAll_Verify a backlog:ExecutionTask ; rdfs:label "Run the page test of each page and read the logs"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage11 ; backlog:hasTaskType backlog:TaskType_Verify ; backlog:hasState backlog:Blocked ;
    backlog:dependsOn ex:TK11_ExamResultsAll_Pages .
